      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"GenerateLabReports-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><p>OpenELIS provides a functionality to generate three types of reports:</p><ul><li>Status Reports</li><li>Audit Reports</li><li>Aggregate Reports</li></ul><h2 id=\"GenerateLabReports-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Reports are used by the hospital/laboratory administrator for extracting data in predefined formats and is used for generating metrics and analysis</span>.</p><h2 id=\"GenerateLabReports-HowisitUsed?\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></h2><h3 id=\"GenerateLabReports-1.AccessOpenELISReports\">1. Access OpenELIS Reports</h3><p>The user has to log-in to OpenELIS and mouse-over the Reports button. This opens a drop-down where the user can select the type of report they want to generate.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-04%20at%201.40.45%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457079127453&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=138\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-04%20at%201.40.45%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457079127453&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"44499007\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-04 at 1.40.45 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"256ae927-3a2b-4fa5-9d1d-834165b1c19a\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-04%20at%201.40.45%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457079127453&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=276 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-04%20at%201.40.45%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457079127453&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=138 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>OpenELIS Reports</strong></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"GenerateLabReports-2.GenerateVariousLabReports\"><strong>2. Generate Various Lab Reports</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Select the Lab Report that is to be generated. The options available are as follows:</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"GenerateLabReports-a.AggregateReports\">a. Aggregate Reports</h4><p>This report is generated for a date range and gives the information of all the tests performed in the given date range. It shows the number of times a test was ordered and the status of the orders.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%205.47.31%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704050613&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=588\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%205.47.31%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704050613&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837847\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 5.47.31 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"a4aacd4b-30bf-45c2-9cd1-2a835f779055\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%205.47.31%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704050613&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=815&amp;height=685 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%205.47.31%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704050613&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=588 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Aggregate Reports</strong></p><h4 id=\"GenerateLabReports-b.AuditReports\">b. Audit Reports</h4><p>This report is generated by the accession number and gives the audit information of the tests performed. It shows if the values of test results were changed and displays the old value and new value. It lists the reason for changing the result and also records the date and time of capturing the old and new values of the test result.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%204.48.40%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704112638&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=353\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%204.48.40%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704112638&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837848\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 4.48.40 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"061a8989-f6c3-4b17-a28f-06e332ed2790\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%204.48.40%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704112638&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=706 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%204.48.40%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704112638&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=353 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Audit Reports</strong></p><h4 id=\"GenerateLabReports-c.StatusReports\">c. Status Reports</h4><p>This report can be generated by accession number or patient ID. This report gives the status of a patient's lab tests and the results of the tests.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%205.01.20%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704172663&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=647&amp;height=296\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%205.01.20%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704172663&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837849\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-07 at 5.01.20 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"ed826e87-815b-475d-bc67-caddb41cedb3\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%205.01.20%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704172663&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=647&amp;height=296 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014457/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-07%20at%205.01.20%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704172663&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=647&amp;height=296 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Status Reports</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f705fc57-4527-4a56-9225-8054abae3689\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"728f5173-3fe4-4989-9d48-06dbe1fd1fc0\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div> <p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><di